  "markdown": "Certificate of Origin\n\n\n<table>\n<tr><td>1. Exporter's name, address, country:<br>GUANGZHOU Y. Z. F. IMP. &amp; EXP. TRADING CO., LTD<br>RM 302, NO/65 XIATIAN TWELVE RD, YONGTAIYUAN,<br>BAIYUN, GUANGZHOU, CHINA<br>O/B SHISHI HAODESHENG IND CO., LTD</td><td rowspan=\"2\">Certificate No.: L114401804580001<br><br><br>CERTIFICATE OF ORIGIN<br><br>Form for China-Costa Rica Free Trade Agreement<br><br>Issued in THE PEOPLE'S REPUBLIC OF CHINA<br>(see Overleaf Instruction)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2. Producer's name and address, if known:<br>SHISHI HAODESHENG IND CO., LTD<br>HAODESHENG INDUSTRIAL DISTRICT, XUESHANG<br>VILLAGE, BAOGAI TOWAN, SHISHI CITY, FUJIAN, CHINA</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3. Importer's name, address, country:<br>NIALA SERVICIOS DBA FUSION<br>HEREDIA CENTRO, AVENIDA 6, CALLE 0 HEREDIA,<br>SAN JOSE 2729-3000, COSTA RICA<br>TEL: 2291-2149 FAX 2291-6281</td><td>For Official Use Only:</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4. Means of transport and route (as far as known)<br><br>Departure Date: NOV. 03, 2011</td><td>5. Remarks:<br>***</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Vessel/Flight/Train/Vehicle No.:    XIANG XING V. BN02W</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Port of loading:  XIAMEN, CHINA</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Port of discharge:  SAN JOSE, COSTA RICA<br>FROM XIAMEN, CHINA TO SAN JOSE,<br>COSTA RICA BY SEA</td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<table>\n<tr><td>6.Item number (Max. 20)</td><td>7. Marks and Numbers on packages</td><td>8. Number and kind of packages; Description of goods</td><td>9. HS code (6 digit code)</td><td>10. Origin criterion</td><td rowspan=\"2\">11. Gross weight<br>or other quantity<br>(e.g. Quantity<br>Unit, liters, m<sup>3</sup>.)<br>216PRS</td><td rowspan=\"3\">12. Number,<br>date of invoice<br>and Invoiced<br>value<br>EFIC110367<br>NOV. 03, 201<br>FOB: USD</td></tr>\n<tr><td>1</td><td>SOLE TECHNOLOGY</td><td>FOOTWEAR</td><td>6403.99</td><td>\"WO\"</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td>INC</td><td>FOOTWEAR</td><td>6403.91</td><td>\"WO\"</td><td>216PRS</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>